# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Local secrets — never commit these
.env
*.env
client_secret*.json
service_account*.json
token.json

# Bot runtime data (stored on the `bot-data` branch by the workflow).
# These are anchored to the repository root on purpose: an unanchored `data/` also
# swallowed bsdc_news/cortex/lexicon/data/, so the engine's bundled knowledge base
# (gazetteer, FAQ patterns, synonyms, style guide, tech terms) was never committed
# and vanished on the first clean checkout — silently, because the loader falls back
# to empty defaults. tests/test_lexicon.py now fails loudly if that happens again.
botdata/
/data/
reports/
public/
preview.html

# The lexicon knowledge base is source code, not runtime data.
!bsdc_news/cortex/lexicon/data/
!bsdc_news/cortex/lexicon/data/**
